WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
<v Zoe>Okay, let's get started.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Zoe>I won't be able to interview two candidates for the designer role this week.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
<v Zoe>Let me explain how the process works.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
<v Lucas>I already sent the vendor comparison.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
<v Lucas>Zoe, you'll need to set up the staging environment before the launch.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Zoe>Will do.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.000
<v Lucas>The team agreed the timeline looks fine.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
<v Noah>I won't be able to set up the staging environment this week.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
