00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.000
<v Lucas>The team agreed the timeline looks fine.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.000
<v Noah>Good point.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.000
<v Noah>I promise to write the test plan for the new API by Tuesday.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.000
<v Lucas>Let's have Noah follow up with the Acme team in 3 days.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:49.000
<v Noah>Got it.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:56.000
<v Lucas>Sounds good.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:02.000
<v Lucas>Thanks, that's helpful.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.000
<v Lucas>Great.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Noah>I already sent the pricing sheet.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:24.000
<v Noah>We decided to go with the second option.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
<v Noah>Lucas, please fix the login bug on the mobile app by the end of the month.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.000
<v Lucas>On it.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.000
<v Zoe>Thanks everyone, that's it for today.
